        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>沁园春·雪 赏析选择题 截图</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #d8d8d8;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .page {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 4px;\n    width: 1080px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n  .screen {\n    position: relative;\n    flex: 1 1 50%;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    height: 660px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .topbar {\n    height: 34px;\n    flex: 0 0 34px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 0 10px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n  }\n  .topbar .back { font-size: 16px; color: #555; width: 40px; }\n  .topbar .pager { flex: 1; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }\n  .topbar .spacer { width: 40px; }\n  .content {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    padding: 8px 12px 0 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .doc-title { font-size: 12px; margin: 2px 0 6px 0; }\n  .stem { font-size: 12px; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .option {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin: 6px 0;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n  }\n  .option .letter {\n    flex: 0 0 26px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n  .option .body {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    background: #f4f4f4;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .option.selected .body {\n    background: #dfeffd;\n    border: 1px solid #bcdcf5;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-right: 22px;\n  }\n  .option.selected .tick {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 6px;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    color: #2f9e6f;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .cut-top { font-size: 11.5px; color: #333; background: #f4f4f4; border-radius: 4px; padding: 8px 10px; margin-left: 26px; }\n  .cut-top.faded { color: #9a9a9a; }\n  .answer-head { font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin: 14px 0 6px 0; }\n  .answer-line { color: #d9863b; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .para { font-size: 11.5px; text-align: justify; margin: 6px 0; }\n  .sec-title { font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; margin: 12px 0 4px 0; }\n  .bottombar {\n    flex: 0 0 42px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 6px 8px;\n    background: #fff;\n    border-top: 1px solid #eee;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .btn {\n    flex: 1 1 50%;\n    height: 30px;\n    line-height: 30px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n  }\n  .btn.grey { background: #e8e8e8; color: #888; }\n  .btn.yellow { background: #f6c344; color: #fff; }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    font-family: \"STXingkai\", \"KaiTi\", cursive;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.45);\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    z-index: 5;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .wm-left { left: 26px; bottom: 118px; }\n  .wm-right { left: 120px; top: 262px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- 左侧截图 -->\n  <div class=\"screen\">\n    <div class=\"topbar\">\n      <div class=\"back\">&#8249;</div>\n      <div class=\"pager\">1 / 4</div>\n      <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"doc-title\">《沁园春·雪》</div>\n      <div class=\"stem\">\n        1.（2018秋•南开区期末）下面对《沁园春雪》的赏析，不恰当的一项是（　　）　沁园春•雪　毛泽东　北国风光，千里冰封，万里雪飘。望长城内外，惟余莽莽；大河上下，顿失滔滔。山舞银蛇，原驰蜡象，欲与天公试比高。须晴日，看红装素裹，分外妖娆。江山如此多娇，引无数英雄竞折腰。惜秦皇汉武，略输文采；唐宗宋祖，稍逊风骚。一代天骄，成吉思汗，只识弯弓射大雕。俱往矣，数风流人物，还看今朝。\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option\">\n        <div class=\"letter\">A</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">\"北国风光，千里冰封，万里雪飘。\"这三句总写北国雪景。把读者引入一个冰天雪地，广袤无涯的银色世界。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option\">\n        <div class=\"letter\">B</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">\"惟余莽莽\" \"顿失滔滔\"分别照应\"雪飘\"\"冰封\"。\"惟余\"\"顿失\"二字，强化了白茫茫的[?]景象。\"顿失\"二字，则写出变化之速，寒威之烈。使人联想到未冰封时大河滔滔的雄壮气势。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option selected\">\n        <div class=\"letter\">C</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">\"山舞银蛇，原驰蜡象\"是静态描写，都有活泼奔放的气势。加上\"欲与天公试比高\"一句，表现\"山\"\"原\"与大地相连，就赋予一种奋发的态势和竞争的活力了。<span class=\"tick\">&#10003;</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option\">\n        <div class=\"letter\">D</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">\"江山如此多娇，引无数英雄竞折腰。\"这两句是上文写景与下文议论之间的过渡，\"江山如此多娇\"承上总括上片的写景，对\"北国风光\"作总评：\"引无数英雄竞折腰\"启下，展开对历代英雄的评论，抒发诗人的抱负。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark wm-left\">微课后还有经典考题<br>快来检查自己学的咋样</div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottombar\">\n      <div class=\"btn grey\">上一题</div>\n      <div class=\"btn yellow\">下一题</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 右侧截图 -->\n  <div class=\"screen\">\n    <div class=\"topbar\">\n      <div class=\"back\">&#8249;</div>\n      <div class=\"pager\">1 / 4</div>\n      <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"cut-top faded\">\"顿失\"二字，则写出变化之速，寒威之烈。使人联想到未冰封时大河滔滔的雄壮气势。</div>\n\n      <div class=\"option selected\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n        <div class=\"letter\">C</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">\"山舞银蛇，原驰蜡象\"是静态描写，都有活泼奔放的气势。加上\"欲与天公试比高\"一句，表现\"山\"\"原\"与大地相连，就赋予一种奋发的态势和竞争的活力了。<span class=\"tick\">&#10003;</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option\">\n        <div class=\"letter\">D</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">\"江山如此多娇，引无数英雄竞折腰。\"这两句是上文写景与下文议论之间的过渡，\"江山如此多娇\"承上总括上片的写景，对\"北国风光\"作总评：\"引无数英雄竞折腰\"启下，展开对历代英雄的评论，抒发诗人的抱负。</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"answer-head\">解答：</div>\n      <div class=\"answer-line\">正确答案：C</div>\n\n      <div class=\"para\">\n        ABD．正确。C．有误。\"山舞银蛇、原驰蜡象\"是动态描写，有一种活泼奔放的气势。加上\"欲与天公试比高\"一句，表现\"山\"\"原\"与天相连，更增添了奋发的态势和竞争的活力。故选：C。\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"sec-title\">考点：</div>\n      <div class=\"para\">诗歌阅读综合</div>\n\n      <div class=\"sec-title\">分析：</div>\n      <div class=\"para\">本题考查学生诗歌关键语句的理解，注意结合全诗内容深入分析思想感情。</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"watermark wm-right\">解析hin详细！</div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottombar\">\n      <div class=\"btn grey\">上一题</div>\n      <div class=\"btn yellow\">下一题</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
